    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0501</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……気ぃ抜くなよ。
正体も理由もわからねぇが
女魔道士インカローズ——</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Stay alert. We don't know a damn
thing about that witch Incarose
or what she's planning―</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0502</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>奴が&lt;Kohaku&gt;を
狙ってるのは間違いねぇんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But she’s after &lt;Kohaku&gt;,
no doubt about it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5900</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0503</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……正体なんかどうでもいい。
今度会ったら、絶対にジィちゃんと
&lt;Kohaku&gt;の仇をとってやるッ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't care what she is! Next time
we see her, I will make her pay for what
she did to Gramps and &lt;Kohaku&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C0504</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>できれば相討ちになってくれや。
そうすりゃ、&lt;Kohaku&gt;の仇が
一度に討てるぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How 'bout you two duke it out to
BOTH your deaths? That way you
avenge &lt;Kohaku&gt; in one fell swoop. </EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
